* A set of an external name (Val set ExtA) goes like an equ of one: its uses are relocated
* against the external. Both r68s refuse the set ("illegal external reference") and take the
* equ; a known relaxation (r68togas.md), kept 2026-10-14.
* not r68: refuses the set
* expect text: 00000000 203c00000000 4e71
* expect reloc: R_68K_32          ExtA
 psect set_ext,0,0,0,0,0
Val set ExtA
 dc.l Val
 move.l #Val,d0
 ends
